docs/adr/0003-greenfield-latest-stable.md:3:The redesign replaces the existing thin Next 14 portfolio in-repo rather than restyling it. Same GitHub repo, Vercel project (`dhruv2mars` — see ADR-0004), and domain. The implementation uses current latest stable versions of the chosen stack (Next.js, React, Tailwind, TypeScript, etc.) at the time of build — not pinned to the old 14.x baseline — and takes Vercel portfolio-blog starter capabilities as the feature baseline (see ADR-0002), not as a frozen dependency set.
